## Common Anti-Patterns

- ❌ Synchronous database calls → ✅ Use async database operations
- ❌ No request validation → ✅ Use Pydantic models for validation
- ❌ Hardcoded configuration → ✅ Use environment variables and Settings
- ❌ No error handling → ✅ Implement consistent error handlers
- ❌ Serving frontend source files → ✅ Serve only built static assets
- ❌ API routes conflicting with SPA → ✅ Use `/api/*` prefix for API routes
- ❌ Blocking I/O operations → ✅ Use async/await for all I/O

